│                          │ deterministic multi-start; (2) make moves targeted — perturb one of the vertices of the   │
│                          │ currently-smallest triangle, which is far more effective than uniform random point        │
│                          │ selection at breaking collinearity bottlenecks; (3) use a proper geometric cooling        │
│                          │ schedule with a larger initial step size. All remains deterministic (fixed seeds per      │
│                          │ restart).                                                                                 │
