│                          │ vectorized simulated-annealing local search, but strengthens it in several ways: (1) a    │
│                          │ better, more symmetric initial layout (vertices plus interior grid), (2) deterministic    │
│                          │ multi-start annealing over several fixed seeds, keeping the best configuration, (3)       │
