│                          │ apart the bottleneck triple) mixed with uniform random moves, (4) a two-phase schedule    │
│                          │ (coarse exploration then fine refinement) with adaptive step scaling, and (5) a fast,     │
│                          │ fully vectorized min-area evaluator using precomputed triple indices so runtime stays     │
│                          │ low. The function is deterministic (fixed seeds), handles degenerate configurations       │
│                          │ gracefully (returns the best found even if optimization stalls), and returns an (11,2)    │
