│ patch_description        │ Structural redesign around a two-phase optimizer pipeline: a precomputed triplet index    │
│                          │ array drives fully vectorized area computation; Phase 1 uses a log-sum-exp soft-min       │
│                          │ objective over the smallest ~15% of triangles for landscape smoothing, Phase 2 switches   │
│                          │ to the hard minimum with a minimal-triangle-first move ordering. A barycentric projection │
│                          │ operator guarantees feasibility after every move. Multiple deterministic seeds (lattice + │
│                          │ seeded random starts) are funneled through the same pipeline, with the best result cached │
│                          │ at module load. This combines the smoothing benefit with a hard-min polish while keeping  │
│                          │ everything vectorized and deterministic.                                                  │
