│                          │ backbone, then adds a time-budgeted group-move annealing phase (correlated perturbation   │
│                          │ of nearby points) on the top-3 polished candidates to escape local optima where           │
│                          │ single-point moves fail, followed by a final greedy polish. All stochastic parts use      │
│                          │ fixed seeds for determinism, with a graceful lattice fallback.                            │
