│ patch_description        │ Structural redesign around a single time-budgeted simulated-annealing engine organized as │
│                          │ a small class with precomputed triplet index arrays. Instead of interleaving many         │
│                          │ coordinate-descent phases, the architecture is: (1) multi-seed generator, (2) one unified │
│                          │ annealer whose move sampler can (a) move a single point, (b) jointly perturb all vertices │
│                          │ of the smallest triangle, or (c) perturb the union of vertices of the two smallest        │
│                          │ triangles (a "hinge" move when they share a vertex, which can flip degenerate             │
│                          │ configurations single-point moves cannot escape), (3) a final deterministic hard-min      │
│                          │ polish. All moves share a fast incremental area evaluation (only triplets touching moved  │
│                          │ points are recomputed), keeping eval_time low while the hinge/group moves significantly   │
│                          │ raise min_area. Determinism via fixed RNG seed and a wall-clock budget with iteration-cap │
│                          │ fallback.                                                                                 │
