│ patch_description        │ Crossover of the multi-start coordinate-search pipeline (score 0.82, fast eval) with the  │
│                          │ annealed soft-min explorer (score 0.80). Key combination ideas: (1) keep the fast         │
│                          │ multi-seed soft_search → hard_refine pipeline that dominates on efficiency; (2) add the   │
│                          │ annealed soft-min group-move phase (coordinated perturbation of the smallest-triangle     │
│                          │ vertices with Metropolis acceptance) as an additional refinement stage applied to the     │
│                          │ winner, since it escapes pinning configurations single-point moves cannot; (3) keep       │
│                          │ directed_polish and pair_exchange structured escapes afterward; (4) reuse a single        │
│                          │ precomputed triplet index array for all area computations to cut overhead. Fixed seeds    │
│                          │ ensure determinism; the try/except fallback guarantees graceful failure handling.         │
